subject = "Boogle Guidelines"
recipient_name = "Employee #000000"
contents = "What’s up, subordinate? 

Can you believe the shit comments I’ve been getting on Blep? Talking about Boogle AI destroying the rainforests like I’m personally taking an axe to the trees. Never even held an axe in my life! I hear you’ve been getting quite the complaints too, so here’s a reminder of the Boogle Standard Apology Guidelines:

Maintain eye contact with the customer until they start to raise their voice. Then, bow your head and avert your eyes. This will hopefully make them feel bad.
Degrade yourself as much as possible. You are nothing. 
Speak formally and with pronounced intonation. No mumbling or it won’t come off as sincere.
Read off the provided scripts when applicable. No deviating allowed.

Keep up the work. (I’ll add good when we start seeing results).

- Tucker"
